  Modified since 2026-06-28. The fork point is upstream commit 4a54029ca; every change made for
  Waldlust is a commit after it in this repository's history. Main areas changed:
  - Branding: application name, icons, UI tone, identifiers (co.kr.waldlust.remote, waldlust://)
  - Build variants: bidirectional and incoming-only (preset common password, stored as a hash only)
  - Reporting to the Waldlust admin server (heartbeat) and login/address book against its API
  - Android unattended start flow, file transfer UI, Windows 32-bit (Sciter) incoming-only UI
  - Windows installer (res/inno) and release build scripts (res/wald-build)

